**DIRAC
.TITLE
  Na
.WAVE F ! Activate integral and wave functions modules
.PROPERTIES ! Activate property module (dipole moment; polarizability...)
.ANALYZE
**GENERAL
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*READIN
.UNCONTRACTED
**HAMILTONIAN
!.SPINFREE
!.LEVY-LEBLOND
#.BSS
#999
#.ONESTEP
#.CMPEIG
.PRINT
2
!.ONESYS
.INTFLG
1 1 0
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.SCF
*SCF ! DHF specifications...
.CLOSED SHELL
4 6 
.OPEN SHELL
1
1/2,0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0D-8  1.0D-6
#################################################
**ANALYZE
.MULPOP
*MULPOP
.VECPOP
all  
all  
**PROPERTIES ! Calculating of properties...
.PRINT
2
#.RHONUC
*EXPECTATION
.ORBANA
.PRINT 
1
.OPERATOR
 'xalpha_fc Na' 
 XALPHA
 'FC Na 01'
 COMFACTOR
 1.00D0
 TRS_FLIP
.OPERATOR
 'yalpha_fc Na'
 YALPHA
 'FC Na 01'
 COMFACTOR
 1.0D00
 TRS_FLIP
.OPERATOR
 'zalpha_fc Na'
